2. INTELLECTUAL PROPERTY & PATENT CLAIMS
------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The Author explicitly claims exclusive intellectual property and proprietary
rights over the following technological innovations detailed in the Work:

(a) The unique dual-phase powertrain separation framework (Keula Group vs.
Cabin Group coordination).
(b) The dynamic coaxial magnetic plasma line geometry utilizing localized
cold-plasma boundary layers for shear reduction.
(c) High-frequency flux compressor coupling mechanisms built for V12
powerplants operating up to 22,000 RPM.
(d) The deterministic C++ state engine executing the 'PERFORMANCE_LAUNCH'
and 'QUIET_CRUISE' transition subroutines.

